    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1955646051861647507",
      "url": "https://x.com/rmtiorm/status/1955646051861647507",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/rmtiorm/status/1955646051861647507",
      "text": "I was supposed to fly to Cebu this coming Saturday for another 8-day vacation. I had plans to visit @infinity_spa_ph Cebu again and finally try the newly opened @cebu_alpha. But because of a recent accident and incident, I need to take a step back and focus on healing—so I’m canceling the trip for now.🥹😞😩\n\nGood thing I was able to store the value of my flight in my travel fund (thank you, @CebuPacificAir!). For now, I’ll just stay home and rest up, so I can hopefully squeeze in some spa time next week.😉\n\nThankfully, I’ve got a bunch of holidays coming up—Aug 19 (Quezon City Day), Aug 21 (Ninoy Aquino Day), and Aug 25 (National Heroes Day), plus weekends and the WFH setup.☺️\n\nSo there’s definitely enough time to rest, recover, and ease back in.😊🤿",
